{"id":"tristeza","lemma":"tristeza","pos":"noun","rank":2094,"glosses":["sadness (state or emotion of being sad)","sadness (event causing sadness)","tristeza (plant disease)"],"ipa":"/tɾisˈte.zɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0e/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-tristeza.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-tristeza.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tristezas"},"examples":[{"text":"Esqueça as tristezas.","en":"Forget your sorrows.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/843832","words":[{"g":"to forget","l":"esquecer"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Meu coração encheu-se de tristeza.","en":"My heart was filled with sorrow.","words":[{"g":"my, mine"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"to fill, fill up","l":"encher"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Ela o ajudou a superar a tristeza.","en":"She helped him overcome his sadness.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to help, aid","l":"ajudar"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"to exceed"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Ela me mirou com tristeza.","en":"She looked sadly at me.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to see","l":"mirar"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Esquece as tuas tristezas.","en":"Forget your sorrows.","words":[{"g":"to forget","l":"esquecer"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"hey","l":"teu"},null]}]}